I={0,1,2,3}\{k}, J={k}. If rho_k lies in <rho_i:i in I>, then

 <rho_i:i in I> intersect <rho_k> = <rho_k> !=1,
 while <rho_i:i in I intersect J> = <emptyset> =1.

